-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Recorded-input checks of registers with R, game memory and
              pixels against an independent painted model, deliberate faults,
              interrupt and speed injection, and native pace trials. Real-
              loader runs on disposable NextZXOS 26.11 card copies.

  Replay      movie_reference.rzx; movie_source_start.rzx;
              movie_end_reset.rzx: 61472 frames, 143626 complete native plots;
              registers including R, game RAM and pixels identical to an
              independent painted model; four deliberately broken builds
              caught per recording. Selftest verified and stamped with the
              noir-hud-v1 art.

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104; NextZXOS v2.10 (26.11). Normal and NEXLOAD boot
              and full hidden ROM checked. Disposable-card real-loader
              evidence supplied separately.

  Coverage    Menus, play, speech, initialisation and reset; all eight drawing
              paths. Reference recording ends at 16%, not completion.

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
